<title>USA: Snyder Oil names Mark Jackson CFO.</title>
<headline>Snyder Oil names Mark Jackson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snyder Oil Corp said it named Mark Jackson, formerly chief financial officer of Apache Corp, as senior vice president and CFO.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further information.</p>
